  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LightSide.UniText::LightSide.UniText
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.105882354, g: 0.07058824, b: 0.14901961, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  pointerRoutingProfile:
    id: 
  text: '<h>Formulas</h>


    Euler joined five constants in one line:

    \[ e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0 \]

    The normal distribution:

    \[ f(x) = \frac{1}{\sigma\sqrt{2\pi}}\, e^{-\frac{(x-\mu)^2}{2\sigma^2}} \]

    A matrix and its determinant:

    \[ A = \begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{pmatrix}, \quad \det A = ad - bc \]

    Maxwell in integral form:

    \[ \oint_{\partial S} \mathbf{B} \cdot d\mathbf{l} = \mu_0 \iint_S \mathbf{J} \cdot d\mathbf{S} \]

    Chemistry:

    \[ \underset{\text{Lead nitrate}}{\mathrm{Pb(NO_3)_2}} + 2\mathrm{KI} \rightarrow \mathrm{PbI_2}\downarrow + 2\mathrm{KNO_3} \]'
  font: {fileID: 0}
  fontStack: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f97b73f40188e524b8374a6cdee8b200, type: 2}
  fontSize: 29
  wordWrap: 1
  padding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  horizontalAlignment: 0
  verticalAlignment: 0
  autoSize: 0
  minFontSize: 10
  maxFontSize: 72
  followTextScale: 0
