--- !u!114 &1852933559
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1852933555}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: beaa34cb0e58d624bb3a264b28600785, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LightSide.UniText::LightSide.UniText
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.105882354, g: 0.07058824, b: 0.14901961, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  pointerRoutingProfile:
    id: 
  text: "<h>One text, every script</h>\n\nHeadings, <b>bold</b>, <i>italic</i> and <color=#8E4BFF>color</color> share a paragraph with \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064A\u0629 and \u05E2\u05D1\u05E8\u05D9\u05EA, and each run keeps its own direction. \u65E5\u672C\u8A9E carries its reading: <ruby>\u6771\u4EAC<rt>\u3068\u3046\u304D\u3087\u3046</rt></ruby>.\n\n<sprite=cat-sulejman> Pictures sit in the line like letters. A tall one raises its line, a wide one <sprite=unitext-logo> takes its place between words, and emoji \U0001F469\u200D\U0001F680\U0001F98A\U0001F308 need nothing at all.\n\nFormulas belong to the sentence too: the area under the curve is $\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x^2}\\,dx = \\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{2}$, set by the OpenType MATH table of the font.\n\n\u0E04\u0E33\u0E20\u0E32\u0E29\u0E32\u0E44\u0E17\u0E22\u0E44\u0E21\u0E48\u0E21\u0E35\u0E0A\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E27\u0E48\u0E32\u0E07 \u0E41\u0E15\u0E48\u0E15\u0E31\u0E14\u0E1A\u0E23\u0E23\u0E17\u0E31\u0E14\u0E44\u0E14\u0E49\u0E16\u0E39\u0E01\u0E15\u0E49\u0E2D\u0E07 \u2014 Thai has no spaces, yet its lines break between words.\n\nDrag, scroll or pull the bar on the right. Nothing here is an image of text: open the 2 MB tab to see how far one text can go."
  font: {fileID: 0}
  fontStack: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f97b73f40188e524b8374a6cdee8b200, type: 2}
  fontSize: 29
  wordWrap: 1
  padding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  horizontalAlignment: 0
  verticalAlignment: 0
  autoSize: 0
  minFontSize: 10
  maxFontSize: 72
  followTextScale: 0
  fitSteps:
    items: []
  styles:
    items: []
  stylePresets:
    items:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: dab81cf1b3c268f41b034f9e20903ece, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 181ef53b6b8cc744c8e035aa50cf364c, type: 2}
